WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:05,890
What's going on

2
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:11,130
My chopsticks

3
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:13,330
You told me this was a literary conspiracy that needed to be assassinated.

4
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:14,610
Would you please report him to death?

5
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:33,380
It was definitely a trap and the killing was wrong. This is Qi Jun's mystery detective.

6
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:34,540
Come and assassinate Mr. Li

7
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,380
Qi Jun is so confused

8
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:37,660
He actually sent someone to kill him

9
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,740
These dozen people are not enough for His Majesty.

10
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:42,140
A certain family is so scared

11
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,540
They must be afraid of someone's clever plan

12
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:44,620
Just came to assassinate

13
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:46,540
Your Highness, can you send more people to protect a certain family?

14
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,180
This man of letters has no abdominal muscles

15
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,560
Mr. Li cares about me

16
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,920
I will definitely send someone to protect your family.

17
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:56,200
I will give you a place to sleep tonight. Thank you, Your Highness.

18
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:01,080
A certain family is really afraid that something will happen to His Highness.

19
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,280
A rider came from outside the city and screamed

20
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,680
The name is called to ask the Black Sand God General to go out and challenge him.
